Modifications in this application include: CLL/EG1/EG2 extraction; adding all
oriented-top cases; algorithm notation normalization; explicit starting setups,
final AUFs and cube-frame corrections; state-based matching of alternatives;
and correction of one source algorithm's case assignment.

Additional algorithm sequences were consulted from J Perm (Dylan Wang):
https://jperm.net/algs/2x2/cll
https://jperm.net/algs/2x2/eg-1
https://jperm.net/algs/2x2/pbl
Only move sequences and source identifiers are included; no site code or images
are included. Algorithms are mechanically verified. These sources do not endorse
this application. More detail and reproduction instructions: docs/SOURCES.md.
